#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.3.1"
msgstr "버전 4.3.1"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: January 14, 2023"
msgstr "릴리스 날짜: 2023년 1월 14일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:6
msgid "**4.3.1 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.3.1 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:13
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:15
msgid ""
"Fixed: some environment variable (**.env**) values were not reflected in "
"Email Config"
msgstr "수정됨: 일부 환경 변수 (**.env**) 값이 Email Config에 반영되지 않던 문제"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:16
msgid "Fixed: TypeError in Validation ``is_unique`` and ``is_not_unique``"
msgstr "수정됨: 유효성 검사 ``is_unique``\ 와 ``is_not_unique``\ 에서 TypeError 발생 문제"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:17
msgid ""
"Fixed: revert method name ``BaseBuilder::resetQuery()`` changed "
"accidentally"
msgstr "수정됨: 실수로 변경된 메서드 이름 ``BaseBuilder::resetQuery()`` 복원"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:18
msgid ""
"Fixed: handling float in Validation Strcit Rules (``greater_than``, "
"``greater_than_equal_to``, ``less_than``, ``less_than_equal_to``)"
msgstr ""
"수정됨: 유효성 검사 엄격한 규칙 (``greater_than``, ``greater_than_equal_to``, "
"``less_than``, ``less_than_equal_to``)에서 float 처리 문제"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:19
msgid ""
"Fixed: missing instruction for ``Config\\Exceptions`` in PHP 8.2 in the "
"user guide"
msgstr "수정됨: 사용자 가이드에서 PHP 8.2의 ``Config\\Exceptions``\ 에 대한 설명 누락"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.1.rst:21
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
